From: Proton CRM <build@proton.local>
Subject: [PATCH 0094] conversation sidebar: in-CRM call recording player (signed backend link, transcript, re-transcribe; shared useProtonCallRecording composable)

diff --git a/app/javascript/dashboard/components/proton/ProtonCallRecordingPanel.vue b/app/javascript/dashboard/components/proton/ProtonCallRecordingPanel.vue
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b34438a
--- /dev/null
